      </div>
      <div class="iv-about-stat">
        <span class="iv-about-stat__num">$50+</span>
        <span class="iv-about-stat__label">Free Shipping</span>
      </div>
      <div class="iv-about-stat">
        <span class="iv-about-stat__num">S-Rank</span>
        <span class="iv-about-stat__label">Quality Guaranteed</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ── TABS ── {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="iv-about-tabs">
    <button class="iv-about-tab active" data-tab="story">
      <span class="iv-about-tab__icon">📖</span>
      Our Story
    </button>
    <button class="iv-about-tab" data-tab="values">
      <span class="iv-about-tab__icon">🏆</span>
      Our Values
    </button>
    <button class="iv-about-tab" data-tab="products">
      <span class="iv-about-tab__icon">🛍️</span>
      What We Sell
    </button>
    <button class="iv-about-tab" data-tab="trust">
      <span class="iv-about-tab__icon">🔒</span>
      Why Us
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="iv-about-panels">

    {%- comment -%} ── STORY PANEL ── {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="iv-about-panel active" id="iv-panel-story">

      <div class="iv-about-story-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="iv-about-section-title">Our Origin</p>
          <h2 class="iv-about-h2">Built for Fans Who <span>Refuse to Settle</span></h2>
          <p class="iv-about-body">Infinite Visibility started with a single belief — anime fans deserve better than cheap, generic merchandise. We set out to bridge the gap between fandom and fashion, creating a store where quality, authenticity, and passion come first. Every product in our inventory is selected for durability, visual impact, and genuine fan appeal.</p>
          <p class="iv-about-body">We are a US-based anime lifestyle brand headquartered in Riverview, Florida. From vintage-washed heavyweight tees to museum-grade collectible figures and exclusive digital downloads — everything we carry is curated by fans, for fans.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="iv-about-story-img">
          <span>⚔️</span>
          <div class="iv-about-story-img__overlay">
            <p class="iv-about-story-img__caption">📍 Riverview, Florida — Est. Infinite Visibility</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="iv-about-mission">
        <div class="iv-about-mission__card">
          <span class="iv-about-mission__icon">🎯</span>
          <p class="iv-about-mission__title">Our Mission</p>
          <p class="iv-about-mission__text">To bridge the gap between anime fandom and real-world fashion by delivering S-Rank quality merchandise that fans are proud to wear, display, and collect.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="iv-about-mission__card">
          <span class="iv-about-mission__icon">👁️</span>
          <p class="iv-about-mission__title">Our Vision</p>
          <p class="iv-about-mission__text">To become the #1 trusted online anime merchandise destination in the US — a guild hall where every fan feels seen, valued, and equipped.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="iv-about-mission__card">
          <span class="iv-about-mission__icon">🌐</span>
          <p class="iv-about-mission__title">Our Community</p>
          <p class="iv-about-mission__text">We serve hardcore collectors, casual fans, streetwear enthusiasts, digital art lovers, and families who want the best anime gear for their kids.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a0e2e, #1a1f5e); border-radius: 10px; padding: 32px; text-align: center;">
        <p style="color: #ffc72f; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">"This is your guild hall."</p>
        <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 20px;">Whether you are a hardcore collector or a casual fan — the gate is open. Raid the dungeon. The loot is real and the quality is S-Rank guaranteed.</p>
        <a href="/collections/all-products" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 12px 28px; background: #ffc72f; color: #1a1a1a; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none;">⚔️ Enter the Guild Hall</a>
      </div>

    </div>

    {%- comment -%} ── VALUES PANEL ── {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="iv-about-panel" id="iv-panel-values">

      <p class="iv-about-section-title">What We Stand For</p>
      <h2 class="iv-about-h2">The <span>S-Rank Standards</span> We Never Compromise</h2>
      <p class="iv-about-body">Every decision we make at Infinite Visibility is guided by these core values. They are not just words on a page — they are the reason fans keep coming back.</p>

      <div class="iv-about-values">
        <div class="iv-about-value">
          <div class="iv-about-value__icon">🏆</div>
          <div>
            <p class="iv-about-value__title">S-Rank Quality</p>
            <p class="iv-about-value__text">We reject cheap materials and poor print quality. Every product is vetted for durability, visual impact, and authentic fan appeal before it ever reaches our store.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="iv-about-value">
          <div class="iv-about-value__icon">🎯</div>
          <div>
            <p class="iv-about-value__title">Fan-First Curation</p>
            <p class="iv-about-value__text">We are fans ourselves. We only stock what we would actually wear, display, or gift. No filler. No generic knockoffs. Just gear that earns its place in your inventory.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="iv-about-value">
          <div class="iv-about-value__icon">🚚</div>
          <div>
            <p class="iv-about-value__title">Fast US Shipping</p>
