            <p class="iv-about-value__text">Every transaction on our store is encrypted and secure. We use industry-standard checkout protection so your personal and payment data is always safe.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="iv-about-value">
          <div class="iv-about-value__icon">⭐</div>
          <div>
            <p class="iv-about-value__title">Verified Community Reviews</p>
            <p class="iv-about-value__text">Our ratings come from real anime fans — not bots, not paid reviews. We let the quality speak for itself through honest feedback from our growing guild.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="iv-about-value">
          <div class="iv-about-value__icon">🔄</div>
          <div>
            <p class="iv-about-value__title">Weekly Fresh Drops</p>
