            <p class="iv-about-value__text">Beyond merchandise, we create exclusive anime coloring books and digital downloads — keeping the passion alive even when you are between purchases.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="iv-about-value">
          <div class="iv-about-value__icon">↩️</div>
          <div>
            <p class="iv-about-value__title">Transparent Policies</p>
            <p class="iv-about-value__text">Clear refund policies, honest shipping timelines, and a customer support team that actually responds. We treat every customer like a guildmate.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

